                                                "sense_id": "1887b77a-4a54-34a0-9dca-f317457550da",
                                                "text": "Eggs were collected from the Taylor Creek, Upper Truckee River, and Blackwood Creek traps and transported to this station to be eyed […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
